  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚嗚，嗚嗚嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "小姑娘呀，你看這天色都亮起來了，咱們也走了挺遠的了，就快到了，別哭了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哎呀，有哥哥陪著你，可安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唉......別哭啦別哭啦，都能看到園子了，馬上就到啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咿呀呀——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "怎、怎麼這邊也有！不是說它們怕太陽的嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "來，你......你騎我頭上，抓穩了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叔叔！叔叔你跑快點啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "別，別揪我頭髮！眼鏡要掉了，要掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎啊！嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......烏有這傢伙，跑得倒是真挺快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英雄，您在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？啊，沒什麼，你們快去院子裡躲著，外面的警戒交給我就好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個體型的小墨魎，似乎比尋常的源石蟲要迅速一些......不過好像有點被繞暈了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "竟然真的跑不過烏有哎......？還有這種事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "嘎......嘎啊......嘎啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "看招！嘿！喝！呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哈哈！過不來了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叔叔！你就不能快點跑嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我早就想這麼幹了，那些電影裡的功夫明星，在街上追逐時一定要掀點什麼的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快、快跑！快跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別打我腦袋！真把我當馱獸啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "繞過來了！？這都太陽照屁股了，不是說這些玩意怕光的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "救，救命呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "嘖！喂，小姑娘，你先走，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎......嘎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......是克洛絲恩人！哎喲喂，大恩人呐，您要是幫得到，就早點幫我呀，呃，您、您在哪兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這裡哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呀......！姐、姐姐你從哪裡冒出來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哇！不愧是非同凡響的狙擊高手，神出鬼沒，落地無聲，實在是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐！謝謝你救了叔叔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "趕快回家吧，你媽媽找你很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人呐，您要不趕緊去幫幫炎熔和嵯峨二位？這裡讓我守著，保證周全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你剛才是不是在炎熔那裡信誓旦旦地說會回去幫她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩、恩人，莫非您有那順風耳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這把扇子，怎麼一直握在手上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "欸，那必須的，這把扇子可是我最鍾愛的物件，乃是我那授業恩師相贈，可捨不得放下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "再說，嘿，手裡捧個扇子，不是顯得我斯文嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛才那隻墨魎，為什麼到了這裡也沒事？這裡算是白天了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我也想問啊，給那玩意兒追得可累了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......總之，先去找小炎熔吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......變安靜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "這裡明明是在黑夜邊緣，只能看見一點點黎明，為什麼沒有怪物衝向這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧也覺得奇怪，從未如此安靜過呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安靜些，不是好事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嘿！也確是如此，小僧也總算可以喘口氣啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嘿咻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小心些，別壓壞了貨件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嵯峨，剛才你說的夕娥......那是指？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "自然是“夕娥奔月”這段佳話中的那位夕娥了，哎呀，小僧至今也忘不掉夕娥那雙眸——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......？？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嵯峨，你慢點說。炎熔小姐的臉色越來越古怪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "哦，抱歉抱歉，是小僧心急了。方才抵禦墨魎，想必炎熔小姐也乏了吧？不如坐下喝杯茶，咱們好好敘敘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，那我去為兩位泡壺茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "對了，小僧想先問一句，黎姑娘可知道離開這裡的辦法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "不知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（輕輕搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#3",
